                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta, our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way:</em><br /> ✉️<span style="color:#0054a6;">&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto: enroll@zetaschools.org"><span style="color:#0054a6;">enroll@zetaschools.org</span></a><span style="color:#0054a6;"></span><br /> 📞&nbsp;<a href="tel: (646) 480-1654"><span style="color:#0054a6;">(646) 480-1654</span></a></span></span><br /> &nbsp;</td>
